      "sourceTextSha256": "3c15b1e45528124d6aac0691a677edf3e4a732136a8eae783dfbae43740995b0",
      "text": "Spend eight days in Brazil, from the city of Rio de Janeiro to a car-free island and on to colonial Paraty. In Rio, you’ll go up Sugarloaf Mountain and Corcovado and see the beaches, the bay and the historic centre. Then head to Ilha Grande for a day on the water, swimming and visiting beaches. Spend the last two nights in Paraty, where cobbled streets and white eighteenth-century houses sit between the mountains and the ocean.",
